# Title: Potential Webshell Creation On Static Website
# ID: 39f1f9f2-9636-45de-98f6-a4046aa8e4b9
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: Beyu Denis, oscd.community, Tim Shelton, Thurein Oo
# Date: 2019-10-22
# Tags: attack.persistence, attack.t1505.003
# Description: Detects the creation of files with certain extensions on a static web site. This can be indicative of potential uploads of a web shell.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((((filemod_name:*.ashx* OR filemod_name:*.asp* OR filemod_name:*.ph* OR filemod_name:*.soap*)) AND (filemod_name:*\\inetpub\\wwwroot\\*)) OR ((filemod_name:*.ph*) AND ((filemod_name:*\\www\\* OR filemod_name:*\\htdocs\\* OR filemod_name:*\\html\\*)))) AND -(((filemod_name:*\\xampp*) OR (process_name:"System") OR ((filemod_name:*\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\* OR filemod_name:*\\Windows\\Temp\\*)))))
